# Static asset caches
*.map

# ML model weights — these are large binaries (the tracked
# bloom_taxonomy_model/model.safetensors is ~418MB) that don't belong in
# git history. Track only the small config/tokenizer JSON files next to
# them; distribute weights separately (release asset, Git LFS, cloud
# storage, or a download step) instead of committing them directly.
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.h5
*.ckpt